    "review": "Do not wholesale remove historical compilation preparation or substitute a new error boundary. The guide and experimental accordion/listbox/radio fixtures drop compileComponents calls and some async/await setup. The Overlay app-initialization case moves configureTestingModule inside not.toThrow and removes the compileComponents operation previously inside that assertion; this changes what failure phase is asserted. All 226 cases survive and 225 complete callbacks are equal, while full helpers/hooks retain the other preparation changes. Preserve owned module-era compileComponents and strict public stability/errors unless an individually executed fixture proves a narrow repair. No actual Angular compilation, app-initialization or advertised-floor pass is claimed."
  },
  "decision": "Do not wholesale remove historical compilation preparation or substitute a new error boundary. The guide and experimental accordion/listbox/radio fixtures drop compileComponents calls and some async/await setup. The Overlay app-initialization case moves configureTestingModule inside not.toThrow and removes the compileComponents operation previously inside that assertion; this changes what failure phase is asserted. All 226 cases survive and 225 complete callbacks are equal, while full helpers/hooks retain the other preparation changes. Preserve owned module-era compileComponents and strict public stability/errors unless an individually executed fixture proves a narrow repair. No actual Angular compilation, app-initialization or advertised-floor pass is claimed. Exact compiler/Node/RxJS/peer floors, consumer/SSR/browser gates, private command-source reconciliation and independent audit remain separate. No publication.",
